{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":312020,"type":"tv"},"checkedAt":1793640058722,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":312020,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/312020","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T17:20:58.721Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"The World Is Dancing","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"ワールド イズ ダンシング","overview":{"value":"Anno 1374, Oniyasha è il figlio dell'artista teatrale Kan'ami, ma non riesce a trovare il proprio modo di esprimersi, costretto a seguire gli insegnamenti del padre. Così il bambino decide di catturare il ritmo del mondo attraverso la sua danza, che lo porterà a incontrare lo shogun Ashikaga Yoshimitsu e a stabilire la forma artistica nota come teatro noh.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"舞やまぬ、いとほしき『花』の記憶。","language":"ja-JP"},"startDate":"2026-07-02","endDate":"2026-09-24","status":"Ended","rating":5.8,"ratingCount":6,"numberOfEpisodes":13,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Dramma"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"24m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":614,"name":"TOKYO MX","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSdroyVthq3CynxTIIY7lnS8w1.png"},{"id":1137,"name":"KBS Kyoto","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j12pSWPsDBxE1mmIpB7M8VRzk78.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1565358,"name":"Yumiri Hanamori","role":"Oniyasha (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zXVwGxsxwEvL1f6wxzTYtxytjDn.jpg"},{"id":117527,"name":"Shimba Tsuchiya","role":"Ishiya (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qyPAAsmnc3ugr4fYq2Jy2VbuXU9.jpg"},{"id":1296667,"name":"Maaya Uchida","role":"Kogane (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrcxZXkIgHU55dMs8C4DKkUohqJ.jpg"},{"id":81243,"name":"Romi Park","role":"Zojiro (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fl9vyA3HEkOyTiZBJBhAR3OSmrO.jpg"},{"id":24647,"name":"Katsuyuki Konishi","role":"Kan'ami (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nYM5cH6U7cp4x9dIzW0enmEKmeV.jpg"},{"id":1966967,"name":"Haruki Ishiya","role":"Junigoro (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5bugNo9kjEpzotXLkvMZ2pJ212h.jpg"},{"id":9705,"name":"Takahiro Sakurai","role":"Ashikaga Yoshimitsu (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8s8owcKmpRAuhzEGjSdRpztthUg.jpg"},{"id":1221143,"name":"Nobuo Tobita","role":"Nijo Yoshimoto (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8p47dHvcEvr7CPYIHpxlQcpZmtm.jpg"},{"id":89903,"name":"Mamiko Noto","role":"Nariko (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wCSD7Umgzc66p8VGXrrMZtSLSuS.jpg"},{"id":1325949,"name":"Inori Minase","role":"Chiharu (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cqOrQDUbbQLKpujzcK47YqjFdNp.jpg"},{"id":4603363,"name":"Hazuki Seto","role":"Satsuki (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fuPZruVoZTmiFUVxQdojc46UufB.jpg"},{"id":622,"name":"Yoji Matsuda","role":"Inuo (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/42WeHwCymsgJh3mLAyknCdRcef8.jpg"},{"id":186341,"name":"Miyuki Sawashiro","role":"Shirabyoshi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11mGqwpmu8CoEy1YJgabj2g7MIv.jpg"},{"id":1264226,"name":"Kenichirou Matsuda","role":"Yoriyuki Hosokawa (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/YCEXgyl763zg62qhsjhWHRzGkL.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The World Is Dancing","overview":"Anno 1374, Oniyasha è il figlio dell'artista teatrale Kan'ami, ma non riesce a trovare il proprio modo di esprimersi, costretto a seguire gli insegnamenti del padre. Così il bambino decide di catturare il ritmo del mondo attraverso la sua danza, che lo porterà a incontrare lo shogun Ashikaga Yoshimitsu e a stabilire la forma artistica nota come teatro noh."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The World Is Dancing","overview":"In 1374, amid the turmoil of the Northern and Southern Courts' long running conflict, a boy named Oniyasha is born into a family of sarugaku theater performers. He spends his days in a kind of quiet gloom, haunted by a simple but persistent question: Why do people dance? Then, one day, he witnesses a dance that he feels to be “good”—and everything begins to change. This is the story of the beautiful young boy who would one day shape the art of Noh and be remembered as Zeami."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"1374年、南朝と北朝二つの朝廷の争いが続く動乱の時代、北朝の征夷大将軍・足利義満は着々と権力を強めていた。猿楽を舞う観世座の座頭・観阿弥の子として生まれた少年、鬼夜叉。「なぜ人は舞うのか」ぼんやりした疑問を抱えながら、気持ちの晴れない日々を過ごしていたが、ある日『よい』舞に出会う。好奇心の強い美しき少年は人と出会い、笑い、泣き、自分の情けなさと向き合いながら、無常の世に生きる新しい舞を形作っていく―","tagline":"舞やまぬ、いとほしき『花』の記憶。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHMPrj7gdCNKqF7VCYNvV3o8nls.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aHMPrj7gdCNKqF7VCYNvV3o8nls.png","language":"ja","width":2106,"height":1065}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/swh5mYGuqixQYwkrfDXfOcltRcl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/swh5mYGuqixQYwkrfDXfOcltRcl.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mcxKZoHg7pY2OvlG4IgQv9LBz4H.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mcxKZoHg7pY2OvlG4IgQv9LBz4H.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oOmQf94idSBnDueIrM3FNQy8IXw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oOmQf94idSBnDueIrM3FNQy8IXw.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":2827},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hjlUuHCkVE9yCtQMF1UigCHsxQ1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hjlUuHCkVE9yCtQMF1UigCHsxQ1.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p2EgxPKTmD8paX8Wa9LwytzHNLH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p2EgxPKTmD8paX8Wa9LwytzHNLH.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":28